00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:14.734
-We do this thing every
week where I send out a hashtag,

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:16.434
and we ask you guys to respond
to that topic.

00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:17.734
This is a great one.

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.367
This one might be my favorite
one we've ever done.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:20.467
-Really?

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:22.133
-It's really, really
interesting, yeah.

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:24.400
So, if you have -- anyone --
call your friend right now

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.767
and say,
"Tune in to 'Jimmy Fallon.'

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:28.100
Something interesting is about
to happen."

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.534
-Oh, really?
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:33.300
-We sent out the hashtag,
#Iwastodayyearsold.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.534
And I asked you to tweet out a
funny thing that blew your mind

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:36.968
recently.
-Nice.

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:40.501
-For me, it was that
croissant -- "croissant?"

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:42.868
-Yeah, "croissant."
-It's French for "crescent."

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:44.501
[ Laughter ]
-Crescent.

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:45.934
-I didn't -- But I didn't
realize that.

00:00:45.934 --> 00:00:47.567
Do you -- If you --
'Cause I was making them

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:50.634
with the girls the other day --
the Pillsbury one, you know?

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:54.334
And just bend it in the shape
of a crescent.

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.701
-Oh...

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:57.701
-Croissant.
-Croissant.

00:00:57.701 --> 00:00:58.868
-That's it, so I was like,
"Whoa,

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:00.901
I was today years old
when I knew that."

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:03.167
So, within minutes, it was
a trending topic in the U.S.

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:04.434
So, thank you for playing along.

00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:06.000
And now, I thought I would
share some of my favorite

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.868
"I was today years old"
tweets from you guys.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:09.868
These are good.

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:12.801
[ Applause ]

00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:14.868
Get -- no, get ready.
These are great.

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:16.901
Your minds are about to be
blown. Here we go.

00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:20.067
This first one is from
@bdwaybrooke.

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:22.667
